===Particle===
{{etymid|ru|particle}}
{{head|ru|particle|head=э́то}}

# {{n-g|Used to emphasise identity, analogously to English "it's me who" etc.}}
#: {{syn|ru|и́менно}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Э́то''' [[я]] [[должна́]] [[проси́ть]] [[у]] [[вас]] [[проще́ния]].|'''It'''<nowiki/>'s me who should ask you for forgiveness.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Э́то''' [[мой]] [[оте́ц]] [[основа́л]] [[компа́нию]].|'''It'''<nowiki/>'s my father who founded the company.}}
# {{sid|ru|intensifier}} {{n-g|Used to intensify a question concerning an observation.}}
#: {{syn|ru|же}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[да#Russian:_emphasis|Да]] [[куда́]] '''э́то''' [[вы]] [[так]] [[спеши́те]]?|Where are you in such a hurry to?}}

